 "remarks": "Introducing 91 Hope - an exclusive boutique collection of 26 residences in the Glenbrook area of Stamford. Designed for modern living, each home features open layouts, high ceilings, and modern finishes. Gourmet kitchens fit with quartz countertops, bespoke cabinetry, premium stainless-steel appliances and large center islands. Spacious bedrooms with ample closet space, designer baths, and private outdoor spaces complete with a two-car garage. Just a short distance from downtown Stamford, Metro-North, and premier dining and shopping, 91 Hope offers an unparalleled blend of elegance, comfort, and convenience. This project is under construction and all showing is through the listing broker with expected completion this fall. Agents and potential buyers are not permitted on the premises unaccompanied without listing agent. Professional photographs of the completed property will be added as construction progresses and the home becomes photo-ready. Images currently shown are architectural renderings intended to illustrate the proposed finished design and may not reflect all final finishes, materials, or features. Listing broker is a licensed Connecticut real estate broker and has an ownership interest in the LLC that owns the property.",
